WEBVTT

00:09.840 --> 00:11.220
Yeah.

00:11.220 --> 00:13.890
But I'm glad that we were able to defeat him.

00:19.140 --> 00:20.140
Yeah...

00:21.060 --> 00:26.400
Turn that voracious sex drive into strength

00:26.020 --> 00:31.950
Daimidaler the Sound Robot

00:39.370 --> 00:45.040
The darkness is spreading

00:44.710 --> 00:50.470
Why do I keep fighting?

00:50.010 --> 01:00.980
I just don't want to lose these days of peace or the sensation I get to feel with these hands

01:00.680 --> 01:06.480
The sound of moaning gives me power

01:05.940 --> 01:09.070
I won't forgive anyone who tries to take them away

01:13.950 --> 01:19.700
Surge with Hi-ERO particles

01:19.410 --> 01:25.130
Attack when fully charged

02:03.910 --> 02:10.130
Hi-ERO particles... the source of Daimidaler's strength.

02:11.300 --> 02:18.970
A Penguin infused with Hi-ERO particles is certain to be able to defeat Daimidaler.

02:13.380 --> 02:19.890
Hi-ERO Particle

02:13.380 --> 02:19.890
Test Subject 6 "Henry"

02:19.890 --> 02:21.680
Hi-ERO Particle

02:19.890 --> 02:21.680
Test Subject 1 "Chris"

02:20.310 --> 02:23.520
But I don't feel like this is going to work.

02:21.680 --> 02:23.310
Hi-ERO Particle

02:21.680 --> 02:23.310
Test Subject 3 "Sam"

02:23.310 --> 02:24.940
Hi-ERO Particle

02:23.310 --> 02:24.940
Test Subject 5 "Jack"'

02:23.520 --> 02:24.940
Yeah.

02:25.350 --> 02:26.190
We can do it!

02:26.690 --> 02:29.060
This time we must succeed.

02:29.060 --> 02:33.400
We have to do it for Ritz, who is providing us with the Hi-ERO particles.

02:33.400 --> 02:35.570
Beginning test number six!

02:39.570 --> 02:42.580
Penguin-san!

02:47.960 --> 02:52.300
This light is definitely that of Hi-ERO particles.

02:52.300 --> 02:55.550
Hi-ERO Particle Test Subject 6: Henry.

02:55.550 --> 02:59.590
Starting today, you will be known as Hi-ERO Penguin Commando Six!

02:59.590 --> 03:00.300
Amazing!

03:00.300 --> 03:00.970
So cool!

03:00.970 --> 03:02.850
Check out those bangs!

03:02.850 --> 03:06.520
My name is Commando Six!

03:03.810 --> 03:06.770
Commando Six

03:06.270 --> 03:10.230
Challenge from Six

03:11.770 --> 03:13.480
Wait up, Kyouko!

03:13.820 --> 03:15.860
Just let me explain!

03:15.860 --> 03:17.240
If you just listen to what I have to say, you'll understand.

03:17.240 --> 03:18.200
No.

03:18.200 --> 03:19.240
Kyouko!

03:19.570 --> 03:21.200
I'm telling you, this is it!

03:20.620 --> 03:23.370
From the front or the back... Soft SM is perfect.

03:20.620 --> 03:20.740
From the front
or the back...

03:20.740 --> 03:20.870
Soft SM is perfect.

03:21.200 --> 03:23.370
No! Definitely not!

03:24.080 --> 03:26.620
While reading this last night, I had an epiphany.

03:26.620 --> 03:28.290
We've gotta try it out!

03:28.830 --> 03:33.040
I'm sure it will be beneficial for Daimidaler! Do it for Daimidaler!

03:35.460 --> 03:38.380
Please say something to him, Professors!

03:38.680 --> 03:39.930
Something.

03:39.930 --> 03:42.970
Please submit the data you gather from it.

03:45.470 --> 03:47.140
No!

03:47.140 --> 03:48.390
Oh, what a wonderful view.

03:48.390 --> 03:50.400
Back-up!

03:57.110 --> 03:58.900
Daimidaler has shown up again!

03:59.320 --> 04:02.570
Is it going to start destroying things, even though there are no Penguin robots around?!

04:02.570 --> 04:04.030
Get lost!

04:04.330 --> 04:07.290
Do you think Operation Fake Daimidaler is going to work out?

04:07.290 --> 04:09.540
I am rather nervous.

04:10.330 --> 04:11.880
Oops! Shoot.

04:11.880 --> 04:13.790
Be careful when you walk.

04:13.790 --> 04:15.170
Hold it right there!

04:18.300 --> 04:20.300
Another Daimidaler has appeared.

04:20.300 --> 04:22.890
It appears the area has been successfully evacuated.

04:22.890 --> 04:27.600
One Daimidaler is enough of a problem. Two is an absolute nightmare!

04:27.600 --> 04:30.770
All right. Let's do this, you phony bastard!

04:49.290 --> 04:50.660
You asshole!

05:01.470 --> 05:02.470
That's...

05:02.470 --> 05:05.050
So this is the fake Daimidaler's true form!

05:05.050 --> 05:07.180
That exterior was merely serving to hide the Penguin robot within!

05:07.430 --> 05:12.060
That's correct! I am Hi-ERO Penguin Commando Six!

05:12.060 --> 05:13.190
Sex?!

05:13.400 --> 05:15.190
He cut right to the chase!

05:15.190 --> 05:16.570
Don't underestimate him!

05:16.570 --> 05:19.820
He said it! He really said it! Didn't mess around with any innuendo!

05:19.820 --> 05:22.150
Now is not the time to play around!

05:22.530 --> 05:24.450
Let's do this, Daimidaler!

05:25.490 --> 05:28.660
I'll show you the power of the <i>real</i> Daimidaler!

05:28.870 --> 05:30.660
Tandem Seat, Back Attack Mode.

05:30.950 --> 05:32.410
Transmutation!

05:32.410 --> 05:33.250
Huh?

05:33.920 --> 05:37.380
Wh-What? What's going on?!

05:37.380 --> 05:40.170
Oh? So there's a formation like this, too?

05:40.170 --> 05:42.880
All right! I'm not holding back on the groping today!

05:40.340 --> 05:41.510
No!

05:43.260 --> 05:45.720
When have you <i>ever</i> held back?!

05:45.720 --> 05:47.390
I can't believe this!

05:50.390 --> 05:53.350
Here I go! Finger Punch!

05:53.810 --> 05:55.480
Tail Punch!

05:58.900 --> 06:01.440
He blocked my Finger Punch?

06:01.900 --> 06:03.700
Daimidaler's left arm has been damaged!

06:03.700 --> 06:05.990
Analyzing energy emitted from enemy Penguin robot.

06:06.320 --> 06:10.080
The reading says... it comes from Hi-ERO particles.

06:10.080 --> 06:10.950
What did you say?!

06:13.040 --> 06:15.210
Take this!

06:18.170 --> 06:19.750
Whoa! He's going completely overboard!

06:19.750 --> 06:21.710
He's no different than Daimidaler!

06:22.170 --> 06:23.800
What are you doing, Six?!

06:24.170 --> 06:26.840
Go to hell, Daimidaler!

06:26.840 --> 06:29.180
Number 10 looks to be in a lot of trouble.

06:29.180 --> 06:31.180
Its body won't be able to withstand much more.

06:31.180 --> 06:34.560
No! Retreat, Six! Abort the operation!

06:34.560 --> 06:37.060
Sacrifices must be made during battle!

06:37.770 --> 06:41.570
The most important thing is to complete our objective of destroying Daimidaler!

06:41.820 --> 06:42.900
Six?

06:42.900 --> 06:44.400
What's with that form?

06:44.400 --> 06:49.160
Six will win. Glory to the Penguin Empire!

06:50.870 --> 06:53.370
Shit, looks like we'll have to take our chances.

06:53.370 --> 06:54.450
No, Kouichi-kun!

06:54.450 --> 06:56.960
Who knows what will happen to Daimidaler
if you fire a beam now?

06:56.960 --> 06:58.460
There's no time to worry about that!

06:58.460 --> 07:00.670
Why does it always end up like this?!

07:02.670 --> 07:03.800
Tail...

07:02.670 --> 07:03.800
Finger...

07:03.800 --> 07:04.670
Beam!

07:14.350 --> 07:16.520
I can no longer detect the Penguin robot's signal.

07:16.520 --> 07:18.270
Did it melt away?

07:18.850 --> 07:21.440
No, we didn't land the killing blow.

07:22.270 --> 07:24.400
What a terrifying enemy.

07:24.780 --> 07:26.440
A Hi-ERO Penguin...

07:31.200 --> 07:35.660
How terrible. Six has assumed a human-like form.

07:35.660 --> 07:37.460
Your Highness!

07:37.460 --> 07:40.460
We can't leave him out there! Send out a rescue team immediately!

07:40.460 --> 07:41.420
Yes, Sir!

07:41.670 --> 07:44.920
Your Highness, should we have Ritz help us?

07:44.920 --> 07:48.680
No. She's exhausted from sharing all those Hi-ERO particles.

07:49.300 --> 07:50.760
Let her sleep.

07:55.770 --> 07:57.810
Penguin-san!

08:10.530 --> 08:13.030
Looks like we took quite a beating.

08:13.030 --> 08:15.870
Shit, I won't forgive you, Sex!

08:15.870 --> 08:17.410
What a terrifying foe.

08:17.910 --> 08:21.170
As long as his heart still beats, I'm sure he'll attack again.

08:21.170 --> 08:23.210
By the way, where's Sonan-chan?

08:23.210 --> 08:24.920
She's visiting her father.

08:25.210 --> 08:28.670
Sonan-chan really hates Penguins.

08:31.050 --> 08:35.720
Right now, Prince is using everything at their disposal to hunt him down.

08:35.720 --> 08:37.850
Don't worry, Father.

08:37.850 --> 08:40.850
We won't stop until every last Penguin has been eradicated.

08:46.360 --> 08:47.860
I'll see you again.

09:04.080 --> 09:05.880
My balloon!

09:23.980 --> 09:25.480
Thank you.

09:42.210 --> 09:43.330
Have we...

09:43.330 --> 09:44.540
Huh?

09:44.960 --> 09:48.590
Have we met somewhere before?

09:51.420 --> 09:58.930
I don't know why, but I feel like I know you. I—

10:02.560 --> 10:03.810
Are you all right?!

10:04.520 --> 10:05.730
Who...

10:07.270 --> 10:10.610
Who am I?

10:21.540 --> 10:23.870
You still have yet to pinpoint Six's whereabouts?

10:23.870 --> 10:26.210
That's right. We have no idea.

10:26.210 --> 10:29.130
He's usually the type to call in often.

10:30.590 --> 10:36.090
Perhaps transforming into a human has affected his memory.

10:42.430 --> 10:44.310
How are you feeling?

10:44.310 --> 10:48.860
I'm feeling much better now. Thank you.

10:48.860 --> 10:51.570
No. It's the least I can do.

10:52.360 --> 10:54.320
You are a kind person.

10:54.320 --> 10:55.360
Not really.

10:58.530 --> 11:03.160
<i>Have I met this person somewhere before?</i>

11:03.870 --> 11:10.250
<i>I feel as though I have. Why is my heart trembling so much?</i>

11:12.880 --> 11:17.050
Sorry for being rude, but may I ask what you do for a living?

11:17.050 --> 11:20.260
Huh? Oh, I work at a beauty salon.

11:20.260 --> 11:25.140
I see. An elegant, ladylike profession. It suits you well.

11:25.140 --> 11:27.230
No, it's not as fascinating as you make it seem.

11:28.140 --> 11:30.520
Even today, I got up to a lot of stuff with my coworker,

11:31.150 --> 11:35.030
and it's really exhausting... l mean, a real battle of endurance.

11:35.030 --> 11:39.660
I apologize for speaking on the matter without knowing the hardships you endure.

11:39.660 --> 11:42.240
But it's a very worthwhile job.

11:44.080 --> 11:49.250
And if it's for my family, I can suffer through a lot.

11:50.420 --> 11:55.510
Family. That's something very important to you, isn't it?

11:57.670 --> 12:00.840
"What I dreamt was something of happiness.

12:01.390 --> 12:03.850
What I wished was something of love.

12:05.430 --> 12:08.730
Beyond that mountain is a quiet town.

12:09.480 --> 12:13.110
And on sunny Sundays, the sky is blue."

12:14.650 --> 12:19.740
My father used to recite that as he gazed across the ocean.

12:19.740 --> 12:21.860
I guess it rubbed off on me.

12:23.070 --> 12:31.540
This person, that person, and the people who aren't here all have a family.

12:31.540 --> 12:33.880
And each one provides a small piece of happiness.

12:35.130 --> 12:39.010
It is my job to protect that happiness.

12:39.510 --> 12:43.140
I hope that I am helping them, even if only a little bit.

12:44.010 --> 12:48.890
I see. Family is something to be treasured.

12:52.650 --> 12:54.400
Live together, fly together.

12:56.320 --> 13:01.150
Like the wings of birds who always fly as one.

13:01.900 --> 13:05.620
If only two people were able to live in such a way.

13:09.580 --> 13:14.330
I wonder if there would be anything more wonderful in this world.

13:17.590 --> 13:20.920
<i>I want to be with this girl.</i>

13:21.470 --> 13:23.510
<i>I want to form a nest of happiness with her.</i>

13:23.510 --> 13:24.590
<i>And then...</i>

13:25.600 --> 13:26.600
<i>Make a nest?</i>

13:27.600 --> 13:29.100
<i>I want to make a nest?</i>

13:36.900 --> 13:38.110
<i>I am!</i>

13:40.400 --> 13:42.070
<i>I remember now.</i>

13:42.070 --> 13:45.240
<i>I am Hi-ERO Penguin Commando Six!</i>

13:45.990 --> 13:50.450
<i>And this woman is Sonan Kyouko!</i>

13:58.170 --> 14:02.220
<i>If I capture Sonan Kyouko, I'll be able to defeat Daimidaler.</i>

14:02.800 --> 14:03.720
<i>I...</i>

14:06.300 --> 14:08.140
<i>l am a Penguin!</i>

14:16.900 --> 14:19.690
<i>For my family...</i>

14:29.080 --> 14:30.080
<i>Forgive me!</i>

14:46.630 --> 14:48.300
I'm back!

14:51.930 --> 14:55.060
What a strange guy.

14:57.400 --> 15:00.820
The footage taken from the battle has been fully analyzed. Playing now.

15:01.730 --> 15:05.320
This is the enemy Hi-ERO Penguin that was piloting the Penguin robot.

15:05.320 --> 15:07.110
This is Commando Sex.

15:09.820 --> 15:11.580
Whoa! So handsome!

15:11.990 --> 15:14.330
Hey, take a look at this, Kyouko!

15:14.330 --> 15:16.290
He looks just like a human.

15:16.290 --> 15:20.540
I believe it is a side effect of being infused with Hi-ERO particles.

15:20.540 --> 15:23.590
All right. Don't let your guard down!

15:23.800 --> 15:27.840
So this is the face of Sex? Interesting, huh, Kyouko?

15:30.510 --> 15:31.600
Kyouko?

15:43.360 --> 15:44.570
<i>He is...</i>

15:48.320 --> 15:49.660
<i>a Penguin.</i>

16:44.170 --> 16:45.880
You are a Penguin.

16:46.920 --> 16:48.630
And you are a Daimidaler pilot.

16:49.380 --> 16:54.600
I can't forgive the Penguins. I won't forgive a single one.

16:55.350 --> 16:57.140
I have to defeat Daimidaler.

16:57.140 --> 16:59.350
If I do not, there is no future for the Penguin Empire.

17:00.600 --> 17:06.480
Like feathers, our memories have fallen and been swept away by the wind.

17:07.530 --> 17:09.990
They will never be one again.

17:14.570 --> 17:16.910
Let's do this, Penguin!

17:16.910 --> 17:19.290
Come, human!

17:21.750 --> 17:23.670
Don't stop! His tail is coming!

17:23.670 --> 17:24.460
Yeah!

17:26.670 --> 17:28.590
Don't relent! Keep attacking!

17:28.590 --> 17:32.050
I know! This Sex bastard!

17:32.050 --> 17:33.680
Tail Punch!

17:35.680 --> 17:39.060
<i>"What I dreamt was something of happiness.</i>

17:39.890 --> 17:42.850
<i>What I wished was something of love.</i>

17:43.810 --> 17:47.400
<i>Beyond that mountain is a quiet town.</i>

17:48.270 --> 17:52.280
<i>And on sunny Sundays, the sky is blue.</i>

17:53.400 --> 17:57.410
<i>The girls in the countryside, dressed up and holding parasols,</i>

17:57.410 --> 17:59.200
<i>are singing a song.</i>

17:59.240 --> 18:04.330
<i>The country girls are dancing in a large circle.</i>

18:05.830 --> 18:10.630
<i>In response, a little blue bird sings.</i>

18:11.630 --> 18:16.050
<i>It sings upon a low-hanging branch."</i>

18:16.050 --> 18:17.550
Tail Beam!

18:17.600 --> 18:19.140
Finger Barrier!

18:22.350 --> 18:24.140
Tail Punch!

18:29.110 --> 18:30.570
We have found Six.

18:30.570 --> 18:31.440
He's fighting.

18:31.440 --> 18:32.400
What?!

18:32.990 --> 18:35.610
Six! What are you doing?!

18:35.610 --> 18:41.580
Your Highness. I have committed an unforgivable sin as a Penguin!

18:42.080 --> 18:44.210
I am taking responsibility!

18:44.210 --> 18:49.170
Don't be stupid. Come back! That's an order! Come back, Six!

18:49.420 --> 18:51.750
This is pretty bad.

18:51.750 --> 18:53.170
Kouichi-kun, his chest.

18:54.050 --> 18:55.420
Hit the center of his chest.

18:55.420 --> 18:57.090
Huh? What's this all of a sudden?

18:57.090 --> 18:58.390
Hurry up and shoot!

18:58.390 --> 18:58.840
Kyouko.

18:58.840 --> 19:00.010
Shoot!

19:00.010 --> 19:03.640
For the glory of the Penguin Empire!

19:03.720 --> 19:06.810
Finger Beam!

19:13.610 --> 19:17.200
I wanted to be together with you.

19:22.490 --> 19:25.080
<i>"What I dreamt was something of love.</i>

19:25.830 --> 19:28.580
<i>What I wished was something of happiness."</i>

19:29.080 --> 19:32.960
<i>All of that is here.</i>

19:34.510 --> 19:36.050
We did it, Kyouko!

19:37.170 --> 19:39.140
Why did you shoot?

19:39.140 --> 19:39.930
Huh?

19:43.890 --> 19:45.140
Sex.

19:58.400 --> 20:00.490
He sure was an amazing guy.

20:01.280 --> 20:02.160
Yeah.

20:03.370 --> 20:05.910
But I'm glad that we were able to defeat him.

20:06.830 --> 20:07.790
Yeah...

20:09.370 --> 20:10.620
It's all thanks to you, Kyouko.

20:11.960 --> 20:13.750
Those are truly some god-like tits.

20:13.750 --> 20:16.460
Thank you, great god of breasts! I'm super grateful!

20:16.460 --> 20:17.670
What did you say?!

20:17.670 --> 20:20.720
That's the way. That's more like you, Kyouko.

20:20.720 --> 20:21.220
Huh?

20:23.140 --> 20:24.470
Goodness.

20:25.310 --> 20:26.430
Kouichi-kun.

20:26.430 --> 20:27.350
Hm?

20:27.350 --> 20:28.480
Let's go eat some barbecued meat.

20:28.480 --> 20:31.230
Sounds good. Let's have a meat party of victory!

20:31.560 --> 20:33.520
What kind do you like, Kouichi-kun?

20:33.520 --> 20:35.860
My favorite is <i>this</i> meat right here!

20:35.860 --> 20:37.230
Jeez!

20:37.230 --> 20:39.240
Is that the only thing you can do?

20:40.320 --> 20:41.490
Stupid.

20:43.320 --> 20:45.490
So that's what happened.

20:46.120 --> 20:49.500
Beauty Salon Prince really is the worst.

20:52.420 --> 20:55.000
See you later, Father. I'll come again.

20:56.960 --> 20:59.720
And with that, a fleeting dream came to an end.

21:00.420 --> 21:05.260
Kyouko, your chest is not meant for the sweet throb of love.

21:06.010 --> 21:11.270
It exists to be fondled like crazy. Do your best, Sonan Kyouko!

21:11.690 --> 21:16.610
Fight, Daimidaler!

21:17.270 --> 21:18.980
Love love li-li-links

21:18.480 --> 21:19.610
Leave it to us

21:20.650 --> 21:21.820
Yes!

21:21.950 --> 21:23.700
Prince

21:36.670 --> 21:41.300
Don't worry about the force of the stars

21:41.050 --> 21:45.550
Let's let our power out

21:45.340 --> 21:49.930
It's best to think about who it is that you want to meet

21:49.680 --> 21:53.730
When you want to meet someone

21:53.690 --> 21:56.440
Preparation okay!

21:55.900 --> 21:58.230
Let's go then!

21:58.020 --> 22:00.730
It'll work out somehow

22:00.190 --> 22:02.530
Let's go with that!

22:02.490 --> 22:06.700
When we have something amazing

22:06.660 --> 22:09.450
Our dreams are one, two, infinite

22:09.080 --> 22:11.290
Let's go, everyone

22:10.410 --> 22:11.540
Yes!

22:11.000 --> 22:15.500
Let's make our own happiness

22:15.330 --> 22:19.670
Because if you only wait for happiness to come to you

22:19.380 --> 22:24.260
You'll never be able to have it

22:24.260 --> 22:28.510
For a happy future, you have to be determined

22:28.260 --> 22:29.850
Love love link

22:29.350 --> 22:30.970
I want to be a bride

22:30.470 --> 22:32.140
Leave it to me

22:31.810 --> 22:35.690
Let's have fun around the world

22:36.560 --> 22:38.150
Oh!

22:37.440 --> 22:38.150
Yay!

22:49.070 --> 22:57.080
Six, rest in peace. We will not let your sacrifice be in vain.

22:58.330 --> 23:00.750
We will stop at nothing to defeat Daimidaler

23:00.750 --> 23:04.260
and have the Penguin Empire rule this planet!

23:05.550 --> 23:09.720
Great Penguin Commando, the hero, Six!

23:09.720 --> 23:22.480
Six! Six! Six! Six! Six!

23:15.390 --> 23:18.100
I-I want to go out there, but I can't.

23:18.100 --> 23:21.150
Welcome home, Henry! Where have you been?!

23:27.400 --> 23:42.420
Next Episode

23:28.740 --> 23:31.030
A perverted, mischievous, and cool man.

23:31.410 --> 23:33.450
You will become a star in the night sky.

23:33.450 --> 23:35.750
Your tears will be like shooting stars.

23:36.620 --> 23:40.540
Next Episode: "Mad Dance! The Fearsome Penguin Hoodlums!"

23:37.830 --> 23:42.420
Mad Dance  !The Fearsome Penguin Hoodlums  !

23:40.540 --> 23:42.380
Please look forward to it.

23:40.670 --> 23:42.420
Please watch.
